      },
      "text": "Kanat açıp uçmak",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.42802190008498575,
        "y0": 0.456587322806732,
        "x1": 0.6072744810235986,
        "y1": 0.4697002075960861
      },
      "text": "sözü, tuti teşbihiyle ve",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.616525564031608,
        "y0": 0.456587322806732,
        "x1": 0.660810193122895,
        "y1": 0.4697002075960861
      },
      "text": "tahrîk",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6699421933955949,
        "y0": 0.456587322806732,
        "x1": 0.8617124049355808,
        "y1": 0.4697002075960861
      },
      "text": "kelimesinin anlamlarıyla",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.4738336039423172,
        "x1": 0.6227209804632055,
        "y1": 0.48694648873167135
      },
      "text": "birlikte düşünüldüğünde bir bencillik, gurur ve kibir ifade eder.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6239837418878974,
        "y0": 0.4738336039423172,
        "x1": 0.6517079763496417,
        "y1": 0.48694648873167135
      },
      "text": "Hat",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6572431448862324,
        "y0": 0.4738336039423172,
        "x1": 0.8617349604256953,
        "y1": 0.48694648873167135
      },
      "text": "sözcüğünün, divan şiirinde",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.49107992132550093,
        "x1": 0.8612265263579028,
        "y1": 0.5041928061148551
      },
      "text": "değişik, hatta zıt anlamlarda kullanıldığı görülür. Bazen gençlik ve güzellik unsuru olarak,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.5084687280183688,
        "x1": 0.8618273225945906,
        "y1": 0.521581612807723
      },
      "text": "bazen olgunluk, ki kadın açısından düşünüldüğünde evde kalmışlık, bazen de yaşlılık ifade",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.5257150454015524,
        "x1": 0.8612078668160807,
        "y1": 0.5388279301909067
      },
      "text": "edecek şekilde kullanılmıştır. Gençlik ve güzellik insana, kendini gösterme arzusu ile gurur ve",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.5429613265371377,
        "x1": 0.8610595132061,
        "y1": 0.5560742113264918
      },
      "text": "kibir verir; evde kalmışlık ve yaşlılık ise insanı korku ve telaşa düşürür. Bu açıdan bakıldğında",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.5602313860973356,
        "x1": 0.6345472340300896,
        "y1": 0.5733442708866898
      },
      "text": "bu beyitteki “hat” kelimesi de anlam bakımından bir genişlik taşır.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.202412148088423,
        "y0": 0.5846042350778466,
        "x1": 0.46448510540418386,
        "y1": 0.5977171198672009
      },
      "text": "Sanma ki etdi zülfünü tahrîk rûzgâr",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.202412148088423,
        "y0": 0.6091196458632391,
        "x1": 0.26828274005668695,
        "y1": 0.6222325306525931
      },
      "text": "Bâl açdı",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2681246978384524,
        "y0": 0.6091196458632391,
        "x1": 0.2928261634187417,
        "y1": 0.6222325306525931
      },
      "text": "tûti",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29291810267219726,
        "y0": 0.6091196458632391,
        "x1": 0.595533682006762,
        "y1": 0.6222325306525931
      },
      "text": "-i hatı pervâza başladı     Nef’i G.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17076530884584654,
        "y0": 0.6334924948437501,
        "x1": 0.8612195674765777,
        "y1": 0.6466053796331042
      },
      "text": "(O güzelin saçını rüzgârın tahrik ettiğini zannetme, yüzünde beliren ayva tüylerinin tutisi",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6507387759793353,
        "x1": 0.3487820796073304,
        "y1": 0.6638516607686894
      },
      "text": "kanat açtı, uçmaya başladı.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17076530884584654,
        "y0": 0.6751116612074448,
        "x1": 0.4179283695211976,
        "y1": 0.6882245459967989
      },
      "text": "Bu beyitte de yine kesret olan",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.42257946537025254,
        "y0": 0.6751116612074448,
        "x1": 0.5075695773714661,
        "y1": 0.6882245459967989
      },
      "text": "hat ve kan",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.507642933976816,
        "y0": 0.6751116612074448,
        "x1": 0.8618547095732126,
        "y1": 0.6882245459967989
      },
      "text": ",  insanı dünyaya bağlanmaya çeken  geveze",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6925004679003128,
        "x1": 0.3236541102139658,
        "y1": 0.7056133526896669
      },
      "text": "papağana benzetilmiştir.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.202412148088423,
        "y0": 0.716873335004623,
        "x1": 0.5073389987475223,
        "y1": 0.7299862197939773
      },
      "text": "Gûyâ hayâl-i hatt-ı lebinle müjemde hûn",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.202412148088423,
        "y0": 0.7412462021089334,
        "x1": 0.301939683568291,
        "y1": 0.7543590868982876
      },
      "text": "Bâğ-ı vefâda",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3019888442842452,
        "y0": 0.7412462021089334,
        "x1": 0.3266903098645345,
        "y1": 0.7543590868982876
      },
      "text": "tûtî",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.32683264013340513,
        "y0": 0.7412462021089334,
        "x1": 0.6267036264208482,
        "y1": 0.7543590868982876
      },
      "text": "-i zenbûrdur bana             Şeyh Galib G.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17076530884584654,
        "y0": 0.7656190692132437,
        "x1": 0.8613820695303576,
        "y1": 0.7787319540025979
      },
      "text": "(Senin dudağının hattının hayaliyle benim kirpiğimde oluşan kanlı gözyaşı, sanki sadakat",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7829009817381496,
        "x1": 0.41789795805640106,
        "y1": 0.7960138665275037
      },
      "text": "bahçesinde bana geveze papağandır.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17076530884584654,
        "y0": 0.8074163743997427,
        "x1": 0.8613311146276896,
        "y1": 0.8205292591890968
      },
      "text": "Cebrail, Allah’ın öğrettiklerini Peygambere aktaran melektir; kendisine söylenenleri aynen",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8246626736591272,
        "x1": 0.5184471034510261,
        "y1": 0.8377755584484812
      },
      "text": "tekrar ettiğinden dolayı papağana benzetilmiştir.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5219545975044146,
        "y0": 0.8246626736591272,
        "x1": 0.8574427531818496,
        "y1": 0.8377755584484812
      },
      "text": "Tûtî-yi  kuds,  tûtî-i Cibrîl, tûtî-yi  sidre-nişîn",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.8419089729185115,
        "x1": 0.35243230121379043,
        "y1": 0.8550218577078657
      },
      "text": "sözleri ile Cebrail kastedilir.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18306121641626955,
        "y0": 0.9433865466982364,
        "x1": 0.8168722828221258,
        "y1": 0.9552166493661228
      },
      "text": "The Journal of Academic Social Science Yıl: 2, Sayı: 1, Mart 2014, s.6 1-71",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
